Representing the absolute pinnacle of Stark engineering, the Mark 85 perfects the nanotechnology introduced in the Mark 50, featuring far greater structural density and energy resilience. Visually, it serves as a direct tribute to Steve Ditko’s classic comic design, reintroducing full gold plating along the arms and thighs alongside deep red torso paneling. Engineered specifically for high-intensity warfare, it features an advanced back-mounted "Nano Lightning Refocusing System" that absorbs incoming energy (like Thor’s lightning) to blast amplified repulsor beams, alongside heavy energy shields and blades. Crucially, its nanotech structure was designed with a integrated Nano Gauntlet mechanism, allowing Tony to seamlessly siphon all six Infinity Stones directly off Thanos’s gauntlet and onto his own right hand to perform the universe-saving snap.
